    {
      "subject": "SSCI/SENG/AIS",
      "minCredits": 15,
      "maxCredits": null,
      "freeForm": "Bioengineering Electives (5 courses from the specified elective list, of which at least 9 credits should be taken from a single specialty area (Area 1 or Area 2). Out of the 15 credits taken, at least 9 credits should be at 4000-level or above.  Courses taken as Major Required Courses may not be counted towards this elective requirement.) Area 1: Biomedical Data Acquisition and Analytics BIEN 3310 3 Data Science for Neural Engineering BIEN 4310** 3 Statistical Signal Analysis and Applications in Neural Engineering BIEN 5040 3 Introduction to Neural Engineering BIEN 5060 3 Fundamentals and Applications of Sensing Technologies in Healthcare CENG 5240 3 Deep Learning for Chemical and Biological Engineering COMP 2012 4 Object-Oriented Programming and Data Structures COMP 2012H 5 Honors Object-Oriented Programming and Data Structures COMP 2211 3 Introduction to Artificial Intelligence COMP 4211 3 Machine Learning COMP 4331 3 Data Mining COMP 4421 3 Image Processing COMP 5423 3 Deep Learning in Medical Image Analysis ELEC 2100 4 Signals and Systems ELEC 2420 3 Basic Electronics ELEC 4820 3 Medical Imaging EMIA 4110 3 Practical Machine Learning LIFS 3070 3 Introduction to Biophysical Instrumentation Area 2: Bioprocesses, Biomaterials and Bioanalysis BIEN 4110 3 Regulatory Affairs in the Healthcare Industry BIEN 5070 3 Synthetic Biology CENG 3150 5 Integrated Chemical Process and Product Design CENG 4510 3 Nature Engineering and DNA Nanotechnology CENG 4620 3 Bioproducts and Processing CENG 4630 3 Food Processing Technology CENG 4640 3 Biomolecular Engineering CENG 4650 3 Biomaterials and Drug Delivery CENG 4670 3 Pharmaceutical Engineering CENG 5610 3 Protein Engineering CHEM 2111 3 Fundamentals of Organic Chemistry CHEM 2311 3 Analytical Chemistry LIFS 3060 3 Microbiology LIFS 4888 3 Development and Registration of Pharmaceutical Products Other electives BIEN 4000 1-4 Special Topics in Bioengineering CENG 4160** 3 Prototype Development for Chemical Processes and Products UCOP 3200 3 Design for Global Health LIFS 3240 3 Introduction to Neurobiology LIFS 4370 3 Human Genetics and Personalized Medicine LIFS 4760 3 Biochemistry of Diseases",
